<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-INDIA 297-5 AT LUNCH V SRI LANKA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA 297-5 AT LUNCH V SRI LANKA.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>India, replying to Sri Lanka's first innings total of 332, were 297 for five at lunch on the third day of the second and final test match at Colombo on Monday.</p>
<p>Scores: Sri Lanka 1st innings 332 (A.de Silva 146, D.Mohanty 4-78); India 1st innings 297-5 (S.Tendulkar 139, S.Ganguly not out 86, C.Vaas 2-60)</p>
</text>
